  "status": "Beta: provider-led generation contracts keep substantive work with the selected provider and record deterministic fallback reasons. Core helpers persist artifacts by tenant/run/artifact id, atomically append manifests, hash prompt/file provenance, link token-ledger receipts, record structural plus explicit render status, and report uploaded/url/local-only/failed delivery without recent-file inference. Polished provider-hosted skills and MCPs are available only through explicit discovery.",
